{"overview":"در دههٔ نود، پنج نفر از «بازندگان» یک کسب‌وکار غیرقانونی در مدرسهٔ خود راه‌اندازی می‌کنند؛ آن‌ها تکالیف و پروژه‌های همکلاسی‌ها را می‌فروشند. مزیت این کار این است که هیچ‌کس به «نردها» شک نمی‌کند. این تجارت برایشان پول و محبوبیت می‌آورد، اما هورمون‌ها و یک مرگ ناگهانی همه چیز را تهدید می‌کند. اگر این کسب‌وکار سقوط کند، آینده و دوستی‌هایشان در خطر است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"It's the '90s, and five losers run an illegal business at their high school. They sell homework and assignments to their classmates. The advantage is that no one ever suspects the nerds. Their business brings them money and popularity. But hormones and an unexpected death threaten to ruin everything. If the business collapses, their futures and their friendships are at risk.","tagline_en":"","runtime":45,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2024,"poster":"/py0s87C9214KRbZ4kWLQfgsE9ET.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/nBOfmrGBQucUT0kzWJowLT3CpeR.jpg"}],"episodes":16,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["MX","US"],"cast":[{"name":"Nicolás Haza","role":"Alex","photo":"/6bG2rNRo0sUVP2nNdT9HbDJzm6a.jpg"},{"name":"Virgilio Delgado","role":"Tenoch","photo":"/2KuS5JNmwghcZZMSkUIVQAY5mbZ.jpg"},{"name":"Camila Calónico","role":"Marifer","photo":"/oSSpmL7yh8sY0qNKsJw29SNG5RG.jpg"},{"name":"Macarena Oz","role":"Daniela","photo":"/5Ewx5jEU8bd4eP144fEO1GRfafI.jpg"},{"name":"Axel Madrazo","role":"Memo","photo":"/xeSOm4hh6pVrknxu8OValNKqIdz.jpg"},{"name":"Eduardo Maruri","role":"Diego","photo":"/mZj9jwEDxvtBVrLSvjy9ZWu22a0.jpg"},{"name":"Regina Cedeño","role":"Susana","photo":"/riawANaQyvoZ7AroJls6Mt9693G.jpg"},{"name":"Ela Valim","role":"Mariana","photo":"/1K2H4ADN3myJg5rYH1q5tVWJAtM.jpg"},{"name":"Alejandro Puente","role":"Rafa","photo":"/8dqOlNGhPfQR3JENOVCFB0ef1Hq.jpg"},{"name":"Ernesto Laguardia","role":"Director","photo":"/1OgxQEYGys4wBq5TQzR8v2hUyMp.jpg"},{"name":"Daniela Luque","role":"Maestra Ilse","photo":"/imV6yKMrAuNVOGHwNPmjvgbe